<div class="subscription-window">
    <div class="subscription-window__content">
        <section class="subscription-window__plan" aria-label="Тариф подписки">
            <div class="subscription-window__plan-main">
                <p class="subscription-window__label">Pulse Plus</p>
                <h2 class="subscription-window__price">{{priceLabel}}</h2>
                <p class="subscription-window__period">{{periodLabel}}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="subscription-window__features">
                <div class="subscription-window__feature">
                    <img
                        class="subscription-window__feature-icon"
                        src="/assets/images/icons/subscription/content-filter.svg"
                        alt=""
                    >
                    <h3>Фильтр контента</h3>
                    <p>ImPulse запикивает мат и замазывает изображения с капибарами.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="subscription-window__feature">
                    <img
                        class="subscription-window__feature-icon"
                        src="/assets/images/icons/subscription/voice-transcription.svg"
                        alt=""
                    >
                    <h3>Расшифровка голосовых</h3>
                    <p>ImPulse дает возможность понять собеседника даже в шумном месте.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="subscription-window__status" data-component="subscription-status"></div>
        <div class="subscription-window__actions" data-component="subscription-actions"></div>
        <p class="subscription-window__support-note">
            Если возникли проблемы, обратитесь в
            <a href="/settings/support" data-component="subscription-support-link">техподдержку</a>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
